<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" leadingSilence="0.320"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">总不能如愿醒来</text><text for="L2">匆匆咽下纳豆卷</text><text for="L3">像例行公事般不得罪人的一句</text><text for="L4">「一直承蒙关照」</text><text for="L5">翻开手账 一切早已成过去</text><text for="L6">前辈追不上 争辩也赢不了</text><text for="L7">日复一日 能在归途稍作流连都成了奢侈</text><text for="L8">舞吧 舞吧 舞吧 却无人察觉</text><text for="L9">连比 Os Gêmeos 更诙谐的涂鸦也无人留意</text><text for="L10">别再停留 把忍气吞声熬来的正义也丢掉</text><text for="L11">人生没长到值得耗在冷嘲热讽上</text><text for="L12">既然无所谓 就把它留在身后</text><text for="L13">那帮家伙全都在开同学会</text><text for="L14">陪在我身边吧 就以最自然的模样</text><text for="L15">一场羞怯的无谓喧闹</text><text for="L16">苦苦坚持换来的战绩 转眼飞散</text><text for="L17">想成为的自己 却被电线杆缠住</text><text for="L18">发着呆 又忘我地沉进去</text><text for="L19">任性做自己就好</text><text for="L20">既然无所谓 就把它留在身后</text><text for="L21">那帮家伙全都在开同学会</text><text for="L22">陪在我身边吧 就以最自然的模样</text><text for="L23">一场羞怯的无谓喧闹</text><text for="L24">苦苦守住的成绩 转眼飞散</text><text for="L25">想成为的自己 却被电线杆缠住</text><text for="L26">发着呆 又忘我地沉进去</text><text for="L27">任性做自己就好</text><text for="L28">在相见也无法疗愈的世界里</text><text for="L29">化作匿名的自己</text><text for="L30">不必去批判任何人</text><text for="L31">也想找到能让情绪有出口的话语</text><text for="L32">一脚踢开嘻哈</text><text for="L33">拭去浓重的爱影</text><text for="L34">不必去批判任何人</text><text for="L35">也想找到能尽情释放自己的风格</text><text for="L36">连一句名言都打动不了的我</text><text for="L37">或许什么也孕育不出</text><text for="L38">眼前所见并非世界的全部</text><text for="L39">我只是想明白这一点</text><text for="L40">既然无所谓 就把它留在身后</text><text for="L41">那帮家伙全都在开同学会</text><text for="L42">陪在我身边吧 就以最自然的模样</text><text for="L43">一场羞怯的无谓喧闹</text><text for="L44">苦苦坚持换来的战绩 转眼飞散</text><text for="L45">想成为的自己 却被电线杆缠住</text><text for="L46">发着呆 又忘我地沉进去</text><text for="L47">任性做自己就好</text><text for="L48">既然无所谓 就把它留在身后</text><text for="L49">那帮家伙全都在开同学会</text><text for="L50">陪在我身边吧 就以最自然的模样</text><text for="L51">一场羞怯的无谓喧闹</text><text for="L52">苦苦守住的成绩 转眼飞散</text><text for="L53">想成为的自己 却被电线杆缠住</text><text for="L54">发着呆 又忘我地沉进去</text><text for="L55">任性做自己就好</text><text for="L56">贬低别人 再把自己摆得堂堂正正</text><text for="L57">只拎出一句掐头去尾的话</text><text for="L58">再群起而攻之 一点误解都足以致命</text><text for="L59">你到底算我的什么人</text><text for="L60">我的心竟被这种人撕得粉碎</text><text for="L61">想象终究只是想象</text><text for="L62">明明很能熬 却偏偏经不起打击</text><text for="L63">在拿一颗颗心争个输赢之前</text><text for="L64">既然无所谓 就把它留在身后</text><text for="L65">可又没那么无所谓 所以索性飞走</text><text for="L66">既然无所谓 就把它留在身后</text><text for="L67">那帮家伙全都在开同学会</text><text for="L68">陪在我身边吧 就以最自然的模样</text><text for="L69">一场羞怯的无谓喧闹</text><text for="L70">苦苦坚持换来的战绩 转眼飞散</text><text for="L71">想成为的自己 却被电线杆缠住</text><text for="L72">发着呆 又忘我地沉进去</text><text for="L73">任性做自己就好</text><text for="L74">既然无所谓 就把它留在身后</text><text for="L75">那帮家伙全都在开同学会</text><text for="L76">陪在我身边吧 就以最自然的模样</text><text for="L77">一场羞怯的无谓喧闹</text><text for="L78">苦苦守住的成绩 转眼飞散</text><text for="L79">想成为的自己 却被电线杆缠住</text><text for="L80">发着呆 又忘我地沉进去</text><text for="L81">任性做自己就好</text><text for="L82">辛苦了 我好像有点感冒</text><text for="L83">到底是玩笑还是真心 完全分不清也是个问题</text><text for="L84">「收到」也好 灾祸也罢 我都讨厌</text><text for="L85">走在夜路上 偶尔沉进孤独里</text><text for="L86">偶尔也会与穿着奇怪睡衣的人四目相对</text><text for="L87">我只想让这样的时光再多一点</text><text for="L88">可夜路走久了还是会着凉</text><text for="L89">总盯着别人的缺点</text><text for="L90">指指点点 却总把自己的问题撇在一边</text><text for="L91">心和身体都一点点耗尽</text><text for="L92">这样的我 哪有资格高高在上</text><text for="L93">我什么都无法斩钉截铁地断言</text><text for="L94">真能说得笃定的 也只是反复说给自己听的话</text><text for="L95">我还能再次笑得满地打滚 直到肋骨都要笑断</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>ACAね</songwriter></songwriters><audio lyricOffset="-0.147" role="spatial"/></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="4:14.507"><div begin="16.108" end="30.708"><p begin="16.108" end="17.963" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.108" end="16.820">思</span><span begin="16.820" end="16.945">い</span><span begin="16.945" end="17.143">通</span><span begin="17.143" end="17.352">りに</span><span begin="17.352" end="17.963">起きれない</span></p><p begin="17.973" end="20.052" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.973" end="18.478">急</span><span begin="18.478" end="18.769">いで</span><span begin="18.769" end="19.211">飲み込む</span><span begin="19.211" end="20.052">納豆巻き</span></p><p begin="20.062" end="22.563" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.062" end="20.315">当</span><span begin="20.315" end="20.571">たり</span><span begin="20.571" end="20.867">障</span><span begin="20.867" end="21.197">りのない</span><span begin="21.197" end="21.785">儀式</span><span begin="21.872" end="22.049">み</span><span begin="22.049" end="22.563">たいな</span></p><p begin="22.574" end="23.641" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.574" end="22.987">お世話</span><span begin="22.987" end="23.130">に</span><span begin="23.130" end="23.641">なってます</span></p><p begin="23.651" end="25.384" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.651" end="24.247">手帳</span><span begin="24.247" end="24.782">開くと</span><span begin="24.876" end="25.159">もう</span><span begin="25.159" end="25.384">過去</span></p><p begin="25.394" end="27.262" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.394" end="26.002">先輩</span><span begin="26.002" end="26.116">に</span><span begin="26.116" end="26.766">追い越せない</span><span begin="26.766" end="27.115">論破</span><span begin="27.115" end="27.262">と</span></p><p begin="27.372" end="30.708" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.372" end="27.774">明</span><span begin="27.774" end="27.874">る</span><span begin="27.874" end="28.113">日も</span><span begin="28.113" end="28.610">来る日も</span> <span begin="28.610" end="29.151">道草</span><span begin="29.206" end="29.507">食って</span><span begin="29.507" end="29.806">帰</span><span begin="29.806" end="29.989">るが</span><span begin="29.989" end="30.708">贅沢</span></p></div><div begin="30.837" end="47.206"><p begin="30.837" end="34.518" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.837" end="31.305">もう</span><span begin="31.305" end="31.741">ダンス</span><span begin="31.741" end="32.207">ダンス</span><span begin="32.207" end="32.655">ダンス</span> <span begin="32.655" end="33.137">誰</span><span begin="33.137" end="33.407">も</span><span begin="33.407" end="34.105">気づいて</span><span begin="34.105" end="34.518">ない</span></p><p begin="34.528" end="38.190" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.528" end="35.430">ジェメオス</span><span begin="35.430" end="36.176">よりも</span><span begin="36.176" end="36.798">ゆうもわな</span><span begin="36.798" end="37.262">落</span><span begin="37.262" end="37.731">書き</span><span begin="37.731" end="38.190">に</span></p><p begin="38.200" end="41.832" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.200" end="38.666">もう</span><span begin="38.666" end="39.098">ステイ</span><span begin="39.098" end="39.498">ステイ</span><span begin="39.498" end="39.965">捨てる</span> <span begin="39.965" end="40.437">下</span><span begin="40.437" end="40.933">積み</span><span begin="40.933" end="41.832">正義</span></p><p begin="41.842" end="47.206" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.842" end="42.630">嫌味</span><span begin="42.630" end="42.802">に</span><span begin="42.802" end="42.999">費</span><span begin="42.999" end="43.682">やすほど</span><span begin="43.682" end="44.183">人生</span><span begin="44.183" end="44.634">長</span><span begin="44.634" end="44.866">く</span><span begin="44.866" end="45.300">ない</span><span begin="45.300" end="47.206">の</span></p></div><div begin="49.599" end="1:18.846"><p begin="49.599" end="51.286" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.599" end="50.561">どうでもいいから</span><span begin="50.561" end="51.002">置いてっ</span><span begin="51.002" end="51.286">た</span></p><p begin="51.396" end="53.224" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.396" end="51.929">あいつら</span><span begin="51.929" end="52.395">全員</span><span begin